<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important safety and accuracy disclaimer for TubWise hot tub guides and tools."
  path="/disclaimer"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Disclaimer' }]}
>
  <p>
    TubWise provides general educational information for hot tub owners. It is not
    professional repair advice, an electrical inspection, or a substitute for your
    spa&apos;s owner manual.
  </p>

  <h2 id="safety">Safety</h2>
  <p>
    Do not attempt electrical work, gas appliance service, structural repairs, or any
    task beyond your skill and local code requirements. If you smell burning, see
    scorched wiring, experience repeated breaker trips, or suspect a structural leak,
    power down the spa and contact a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep guides accurate and cite sources where practical. Spa brands,
    controllers, and local codes vary. Always confirm steps against your manufacturer
    documentation.
  </p>

  <h2 id="no-warranty">No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    Content and tools are provided as-is without warranties of completeness or fitness
    for a particular purpose. Use your own judgment and professional help when needed.
  </p>

  <p>
    Related pages:{' '}
    <a href="/terms">Terms</a>, <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, and{' '}
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
